{"at":"2026-10-05T11:37:51.564Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"MDN官方规范证实addEventListener在同一目标重复添加同参数的具名函数引用时会自动丢弃重复项，但匿名函数/箭头函数每次生成新引用会导致监听器重复累积。AppController.init的重试与安全清理必须持有固定具名函数引用或状态门禁，以防重复注册导致多次调度。","content":"The method addEventListener() works by adding a function, or an object that implements a handleEvent() function, to the list of event listeners for the specified event type on the EventTarget on which it's called. If the function or object is already in the list of event listeners for this target, the function or object is not added a second time. Note: If a particular anonymous function is in the list of event listeners registered for a certain target, and then later in the code, an identical anonymous function is given in an addEventListener call, the second function will also be added to the list of event listeners for that target. Indeed, anonymous functions are not identical even if defined using the same unchanging source-code called repeatedly, even if in a loop. Repeatedly defining the same unnamed function in such cases can be problematic.","scope":"AppController.init 显式初始化、监听绑定与重复调用/重试安全清理规范","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget/addEventListener"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording addEventListener evidence","toolSummary":"Record addEventListener evidence"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":128,"imagePath":null}
